==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
A Hippoe spawns at the start, and a couple Zackie Pengs spawn over the first minute or two. You can use this time to farm money, but the Zackie Pengs pack a punch so you probably won't be able to for very long.

Once you damage the base, a trio of Zory, Zomboe and LeMurr spawn and knock your units back with a shockwave. The Zombies will burrow past your frontline and harass your ranged units, and if you don't have backup [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] in reserve they can set you back considerably.

Try to knock the LeMurr back over and over again with fast attackers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]]. Then take out the base with [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] or [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]].

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Try making use of anti-Zombie cats such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]], [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]], and others to kill all the Zombies in the stage, once the base is hit, the boss poses no threat at all.

